WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:03.980
Everyone remembers where they were that day.

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:10.340
The day of the event. We were only 50 miles from Ground Zero.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:21.060
The event took people we cared about but it also left a part of them behind. Remnants.

00:00:28.189 --> 00:00:30.289
"Well, there's a lot we still don't understand.

00:00:30.929 --> 00:00:32.929
"They might be playing out moments of their life,

00:00:33.899 --> 00:00:35.899
of their own death,

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.519
and no matter what, they can't communicate with you. They can't touch."

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:43.930
"What's up with you and ghost boy?" "Ghost boy?"

00:00:45.449 --> 00:00:47.899
"Kirkland. He's like, obsessed with Remns."

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:53.839
"I've seen you in class. You have more questions that some people seem to. You're awake."

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:08.139
"I saw this new remnant! Help me figure out who this Rem is." "Why do you care? What makes him so special?"

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:10.660
"I think he might want to hurt me."

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:14.430
"He's a killer."

00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:18.190
"When we die we leave an echo of ourselves behind.

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:26.440
These echoes, they can become doorways through which a person can reach back and touch the living."

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:32.390
"I don't know how to stop it."

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:35.460
"I'm afraid you... don't have much time."

00:01:45.799 --> 00:01:50.659
In a world where the dead walk among the living nothing is as it seems

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:07.680
 

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:11.040
 

